In the following graph, discovery time stamps and finishing time stamps of Depth First Search (DFS) are shown as x/y, where x is discovery time stamp and y is finishing time stamp. <image 1> shows which of the following depth first forests?

(A) {a, b, e} {c, d, h} {f, g}
(B) {a, b, e} {f, g} {c, d} {h}
(C) {a, b, e} {f, g} {c, d} {h}
(D) {a, b, e} {c, d, f, g, h}


Answer the preceding multiple choice question. The last line of your response should be of the following format: 'Answer: $LETTER' (without quotes) where LETTER is one of options. Think step by step before answering.
